 ('Reading · An email',mail('prof.hale@univ.example','mara.costa@univ.example','Re: Your draft essay on moral realism',['Dear Mara,','Thank you for the draft. I am **convinced** that your central claim is sound, but I am not yet **persuaded** to accept the second argument. You have **convinced me that** moral facts are mind-independent; you have not **persuaded me to** abandon my doubts about their motivational force.','**Convincing** an audience is a matter of belief; **persuading** it is a matter of action. If you wish to **talk me into** your reading, **adduce** evidence rather than rhetoric. I would be glad to look at a revised version.','Best wishes, Prof. Hale'],gloss=[('sound','válido, bem fundamentado'),('mind-independent','independente da mente'),('adduce','apresentar como prova'),('motivational force','força motivacional')])),
 [('Prof. Hale accepts Mara’s central claim.','T','convinced that your central claim is sound.'),('He asks for more rhetoric.','F','evidence rather than rhetoric.'),('Mara has already revised the essay.','NG','He only offers to look at a revised version.')],
 [('“convince someone that…” = ?',['convencer alguém de que…','convidar alguém a…','convir a alguém que…'],0,'convince + that.'),('“talk someone into” = ?',['levar alguém a fazer algo por conversa','falar com','falar dentro'],0,'talk into = persuadir.')],
