 ('Reading · An interview',iv('A philosopher of mind answers questions about consciousness and artificial minds.',[('Interviewer: Can a machine be conscious?','I would be **reluctant to say** yes or no. **It seems to me** that we lack a **settled theory** of consciousness, so any verdict is **premature**.'),('Interviewer: Isn’t behaviour enough evidence?','**Not necessarily.** A system might **behave as if** it understood without there being anything it is **like** to be that system. That is the **hard problem**.'),('Interviewer: So are you sceptical?','**Cautiously.** I **would not rule it out**, but I would **demand** more than fluent conversation before **attributing** an inner life.')],gloss=[('settled','consolidada'),('premature','prematuro'),('hard problem','problema difícil'),('attribute','atribuir')])),
